	&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfChangesInOfficersDirectorsMajorSecurityHoldersAndVotingPowersOfTheRespondentTextBlock>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HHFB845F6A13C048AB10E053139FD9FDD6" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.7pt; margin-left: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 12.45pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;LS POWER GRID CALIFORNIA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;, LLC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 3.7pt; margin-left: 6pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: center; line-height: 12.45pt; widows: 0; orphans: 0;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;NOTES TO FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(1)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt; and Basis of Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 40.5pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -31.5pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Organization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;California Transmission Development, LLC (California Transmission) was formed on August 15, 2008 as a Delaware limited liability company. The name of California Transmission was amended to LS Power Grid California, LLC (the Company) on February 28, 2019.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; The Company is owned by LS Power Grid California Holdings, LLC (California Holdings). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;The Company was formed to develop, own, and operate transmission projects in the area operated by the California Independent System Operator Corporation (CAISO).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; In January 2020, CAISO designated the Company as the approved project sponsor for the Gates Dynamic Reactive Support (DRS) Project (Gates Project) and in February 2020, CAISO designated the Company as the approved project sponsor for the Round Mountain Area DRS Project (RM Project). The Gates Project is a 500 kV dynamic reactive power support substation, to be known as Orchard Substation, which includes an approximately 850 MVAR (megavolt&amp;#8211;ampere, reactive) static synchronous compensator (STATCOM) device to be installed in two equally-sized blocks independently connected to the Pacific Gas and Electric Company (PG&amp;amp;E) Gates substation. The RM Project is a 500 kV dynamic reactive power support substation, to be known as Fern Road Substation, which includes an approximately 530 MVAR STATCOM to be installed in two equally-sized blocks independently connected to each of the existing PG&amp;amp;E Round Mountain to Table Mountain 500 kV transmission lines at the new Fern Road Substation located south of PG&amp;amp;E&amp;#8217;s Round Mountain substation. The Gates &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;Project was placed into service on March 12, 2025. The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;RM Project &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; expected to be placed into service in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;2026. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;In January 2023, the Company was selected by CAISO to construct two new transmission projects, Manning (Manning Project) and Collinsville (Collinsville Project). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;Manning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; will be located in Fresno County with a 500/230 kV substation and an approximately 1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;-mile double circuit 230 kV transmission line.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;Collinsville&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; will be located in Solano County and Contra Costa County with a 500/230 kV substation and an approximately 6-mile double circuit 230 kV transmission line including a submarine crossing of the Sacramento River.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;Each&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; project &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;expected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; to be in-service &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; 20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;28. Additionally, in 2025, CAISO approved a new 500 kV transmission line from Manning to Metcalf (Manning to Metcalf Project). As the incumbent owner of the Manning substation, the Company will be responsible for installing a new 500 kV line terminal position and transmission line segment from the Manning substation to a point near the Company&amp;#8217;s property boundary. This project is expected to be in service in 2034.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;In March 2023, the Company was selected by CAISO to build, own, and operate two new High-Voltage Direct Current (HVDC) transmission projects in the San Jose area (Metcalf-San Jose B (the Metcalf Project) and Newark-Northern Receiving Station (the Newark Project)). In November 2024, CAISO adjusted the scope of these projects to better meet growing demand forecasts. With those adjustments, the Newark Project is now a 230 kV transmission line which is approximately 12 miles long and predominately underground. The Metcalf Project includes two new HVDC terminals and approximately 13 miles of predominantly underground transmission lines. Each project is expected to be in-service in 2028.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;In June 2024, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;CAISO&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;approved two new 500 kV transmission lines from New Humboldt to Fern Road and from New Humboldt to Collinsville. As the incumbent transmission owner of the Fern Road and Collinsville substations, the Company will be responsible for installing a new 500 kV line terminal position and transmission line segment from the substations to a point near the Company&amp;#8217;s property boundary at Fern Road and Collinsville. Each project is expected to be in service in 2034.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 54.7pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -45.7pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Basis of Presentation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8217;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;s financial statements and accompanying notes &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;were&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;prepared&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accordance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;with&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC) as set forth in its applicable Uniform System of Accounts&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.9pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;published&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.95pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;releases,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.9pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;which&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.85pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;is&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.9pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;comprehensive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.9pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;basis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.85pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.85pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;other&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: 0.95pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;than U.S.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;generally&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accepted&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accounting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;principles&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;(U.S. GAAP).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.75pt 6pt 31.5pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The primary differences between the Company's FERC financial statements and U.S. GAAP financial statements are:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0.05pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Accumulated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;costs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;removal&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;are&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;reported&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.5pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;accumulated&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.45pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;depreciation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;for&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.4pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;FERC&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.6pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;reporting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;purposes (U.S. GAAP requires that cost of removal be classified as a regulatory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.55pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;liability);&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.95pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;There is no current liability classification of the current portion of long-term debt; and deferred financing costs are reported separately in the FERC balance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.8pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;sheet;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.9pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;c)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The presentation of regulatory assets and regulatory liabilities in the balance sheet under U.S. GAAP requirements differs from FERC requirements;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.9pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;d)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The inclusion of income taxes as a component of the FERC financial statements pursuant to the FERC&amp;#8217;s Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances, rather than the exclusion of income taxes pursuant to U.S. GAAP due to the Company&amp;#8217;s treatment as a flow through entity; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;and&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;e)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;A portion of Member&amp;#8217;s equity for U.S. GAAP reporting purposes is included in Accumulated Deferred Income Taxes for FERC reporting purposes. However, the Members pay income taxes on their allocated share of the Company&amp;#8217;s income and for purposes herein, those taxes are calculated using the federal corporate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; letter-spacing: -0.1pt;"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;rate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin: 0pt 12.8pt 0pt 54pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 108%; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.5pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;These financial statements and notes reflect the Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8217;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;s evaluation of events occurring subsequent to the accompanying balance sheet dates &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;through &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;June 1, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; date the Company filed this report with FERC.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(2)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Regulatory Matters&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company has received FERC approval to use a company-specific, forward-looking or projected formula rate framework in setting its transmission rates which are collected by CAISO on the Company&amp;#8217;s behalf. These projected rates are updated annually with forecasted information. Two reconciliations occur annually. The first, a true-up adjustment of the formula rate, calculates the revenue requirement for the prior rate year using actual data. The second, a TRBA adjustment, calculates the difference between revenues due under the effective formula rate and actual revenues received during the trailing October to September period. Both adjustments are incorporated into the projected rates in a subsequent year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt; &amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Formula Rate Items&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;On March 3, 2026, under FERC Docket No. ER26-1588, the Company submitted an application requesting authorization to recover 100% of the prudently incurred costs associated with the investment in the Manning Substation Expansion Project if the project is abandoned or canceled for reasons beyond the Company's control. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(3)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Contracts and Commitments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;(a)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;"&gt;Engineering, Procurement and Other Construction Agreements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 36pt; margin-bottom: 10pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;In addition to contracts previously executed, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;the Company and a third party entered into a conductor supply agreement for the Manning Project&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; in March 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;. The third party will be responsible for the design, fabrication, delivery, and testing of the conductor for the double circuit transmission line.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(4)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Financing Arrangements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company ha&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;d&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; long-term debt issuances &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;of $35.0 million and no principal repayments &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;during the first &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;three&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; months of 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;The Company has total debt &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;outstanding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;$410.5 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;million as of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;March 30, 2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 7pt; text-indent: -27.35pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;(5)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font: 7pt 'Times New Roman'; -aw-import: spaces;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt;Member&amp;#8217;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: bold;"&gt; Equity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 27.35pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;Profit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, losses and distributions are allocated in accordance with the provisions of the Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;&amp;#8217;s limited l&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;iability agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; In&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; 202&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;6&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;, the Company received contributions from the Member of $&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;11.5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; million&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="HH26F298D96F05ADD051F0C74B218AC0A3" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4"></ferc:DisclosureOfImportantDisclosuresRegardingTheFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
