  <ferc:DerivativeInstrumentAssetsHedgesLongTerm id="HH3FFE7080B364FD69059BFC47CE7A2B83" contextRef="HH7B7758B43D530B049277B7E198A48CAD" decimals="0" unitRef="HHferc_us_Currency">8672206</ferc:DerivativeInstrumentAssetsHedgesLongTerm>
